      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i want to start lifting to get stronger but i dont really know where to start. can you make me a simple 4 week plan? i want to focus on the big stuff like squats, bench, and deadlifts. i'm just an office worker so i'm starting from scratch mostly.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Start with a full-body routine three times a week, focusing on mastering the movement before adding heavy weight. For your first four weeks, aim for 3 sets of 8-10 repetitions on squats, bench press, and deadlifts, keeping the weights light to perfect your form. On non-lifting days, focus on light cardio to keep your body mobile and recover effectively. Remember that consistency in form is much more important than lifting heavy initially.",
